{"4544440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "COREateral", "steam_appid": 4544440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544440/extras/019f9854dd0bd72b04a43ec67212413b.poster.avif?t=1774379880\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544440/extras/019f9854dd0bd72b04a43ec67212413b.webm?t=1774379880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2040. Corporations have discovered faster-than-light travel.</strong> The result? An interstellar gold rush. Every company scrambles to assemble makeshift robots from spare parts, loads them into rockets, and ships them off to uncharted exoplanets. You are one of them. Rusty. Expendable. Competing against seven other robots with the exact same objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources don't collect themselves. Drill, extract, stockpile - every second counts when other robots are doing the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your resources wisely. Turn your rusty scrap heap into the perfect machine</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new weapons and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create synergies with crazy effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Become a speedy assasin, an unstoppable tank, the ultimate resource harvester, or a map controller. Your robot, your rules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONQUER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take other robots out, steal their loot, and control the richest zones on the map. Out here, only profit matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Coming soon</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544440/extras/019f9854dd0bd72b04a43ec67212413b.poster.avif?t=1774379880\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544440/extras/019f9854dd0bd72b04a43ec67212413b.webm?t=1774379880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2040. Corporations have discovered faster-than-light travel.</strong> The result? An interstellar gold rush. Every company scrambles to assemble makeshift robots from spare parts, loads them into rockets, and ships them off to uncharted exoplanets. You are one of them. Rusty. Expendable. Competing against seven other robots with the exact same objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources don't collect themselves. Drill, extract, stockpile - every second counts when other robots are doing the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your resources wisely. Turn your rusty scrap heap into the perfect machine</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new weapons and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create synergies with crazy effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Become a speedy assasin, an unstoppable tank, the ultimate resource harvester, or a map controller. Your robot, your rules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONQUER</strong></